cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "vina-rescore: interaction-fingerprint rescoring of AutoDock Vina poses for early enrichment"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "<Sutanu>"
    family-names: "<Mukhopadhyay>"
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8243-2138"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mukherjeesutanu/vina-rescore"
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-06"
keywords:
  - molecular-docking
  - autodock-vina
  - interaction-fingerprint
  - virtual-screening
  - early-enrichment
  - cheminformatics
abstract: >
  A modular Python pipeline that rescores AutoDock Vina docking poses using
  protein-ligand interaction fingerprints and an interpretable classifier, and
  benchmarks the result against raw Vina affinity for early enrichment on the
  DUD-E CDK2 target. The scientific concept and design are the author's; coding,
  testing, and documentation were assisted by Claude Science (Anthropic).
